OQjtVCLISuCDaE4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSVLY7H4ucDRHwHLH4svDut_ov8X7X-eGUhYyBQzTlp8A&oe=6AFDCD32"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer Thumbnail.png", "id": "480940980080059", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031423_480940983413392_1285073711481211677_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ndczu5PzFHoQ7kNvwFHy6L_&_nc_oc=AdphQrSmVQ9Pe4GHAm4AV7X2p4BciNIc-EZjiPlN_hqDhdg1Z5N2Bb4xDwuvDev2C0k&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSDsbO2fo0bSzzQfY31CU_o0dX64jRXapO7tr1rtzQp0Q&oe=6AFDCD6E"}, "display_name": "EnvisionVR Design", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Our EnvisionVR app allows you to view your future projects in high-fidelity Virtual Reality.\n\nCreate virtual inspections of your off-the-plan properties in VR. You can talk to buyers in real-time, explain what they are seeing and navigate them throughout the property.\n\nOff-the-plan properties have been sold in the same way for years with brochures, high-quality photo renders, and stylish display suites. Whilst they do the trick, here at EnvisionVR we like to take things to the next level. That's why we created our world-first EnvisionVR app which allows you to view your future project in high-fidelity Virtual Reality and Augmented Reality using a VR headset or smart device. Our VR experiences are completely mobile, multi-person and collaborative coupled with an easy- to-use interface that will enhance your sales process.", "short_description": "Our EnvisionVR app allows you to view your future projects in high-fidelity Virtual Reality.\n\nCreate virtual inspections of your off-the-plan properties in VR. You can talk to buyers in real-time, explain what they are seeing and navigate them throughout the property."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://envisionvr.net/app-privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_ser